    "description": "S.Chand Group Capital India, one of India's leading organizations, is hiring a Curriculum Developer for our Hyderabad operations. We offer a competitive salary package along with world-class benefits.\n\nAbout S.Chand Group Capital India:\nS.Chand Group Capital India is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Participate in teacher training and professional development programs\n• Develop and deliver engaging lesson plans for students\n• Participate in school events, workshops, and training programs\n• Support students with special educational needs\n• Conduct parent-teacher meetings and update parents on student performance\n• Conduct doubt-clearing sessions and remedial classes for weak students\n• Maintain student records and prepare progress reports\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Ed / M.Ed from a recognized institution\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Pedagogy\n• Proficiency in LMS Platforms\n• Proficiency in Data Analysis\n• Proficiency in Content Creation\n• Proficiency in Special Education\n• Proficiency in MS Office\n• Proficiency in Classroom Management\n• Proficiency in E-learning\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Learning & development budget\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Hyderabad, Telangana, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with S.Chand Group Capital India!",
